Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "ID",
    "trade": "batik print fabric",
    "offering": "goods",
    "currency": "INR"
  },
  "hinglish": false,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat agreeing the order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shipment",
      "write": "the shipping receipt or courier booking"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "partial",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "tracking_number"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "carrier"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "6 May 2025\n\n09:12 Seller: Hello, I have the indigo fern batik print fabric ready in our Indonesian workshop.\n09:14 Buyer: I would like four metres. Is the cotton fabric 110 cm wide?\n09:16 Seller: Yes, four metres, 110 cm wide. The total including delivery is INR 4,800.\n09:18 Buyer: That works. Please send it as one continuous length if possible.\n09:20 Seller: I can do that. I will prepare an invoice and book the parcel after payment.\n09:22 Buyer: Agreed. Please send the invoice here, and I will pay through PayPal."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller's invoice",
      "text": "INVOICE\nDate: 6 May 2025\nSeller: Sembara Loom Studio, Indonesia\nBuyer: Name not provided\n\nIndigo fern batik print cotton fabric, 110 cm wide\n4 metres at INR 1,000 per metre: INR 4,000\nPacking and international delivery: INR 800\nTotal payable: INR 4,800\n\nThe fabric will be supplied as one continuous length. Delivery is included in the total above. Payment method: PayPal. The seller will send the parcel details to the buyer in the same chat once it has been booked. Please check the quantity and fabric width before payment."
    },
    {
      "title": "Shipping receipt",
      "text": "PARCEL BOOKING RECEIPT\nDate accepted: 8 May 2025\nCarrier: Pos Indonesia\nTracking number: EE482731965ID\n\nSender: Sembara Loom Studio, Indonesia\nContents: one continuous length of printed cotton fabric\nDeclared quantity: 4 metres\nService: international tracked parcel\nPostage: paid by sender\n\nThe parcel was accepted at the counter in sealed packaging. The sender can share the tracking number with the recipient to follow its progress. This receipt confirms acceptance for carriage; it does not confirm delivery. The postage charge was included in the amount the buyer agreed to pay for the fabric and delivery."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: INR 4,800",
      "value": "INR 4,800"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: four metres of indigo fern batik print cotton fabric, 110 cm wide",
      "value": "four metres of indigo fern batik print cotton fabric, 110 cm wide"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 8 May 2025",
      "value": "8 May 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Sembara Loom Studio and the buyer",
      "value": "Sembara Loom Studio and the buyer"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tracking_number: EE482731965ID",
      "value": "EE482731965ID"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carrier: Pos Indonesia",
      "value": "Pos Indonesia"
    }
  ]
}
